<a name="postgresqlauth"/><h1>Authentication/Encryption Options</h1>

<p>When using the PostgreSQL protocol, there are several options for controlling which users are allowed to access an instance of SQL Relay.</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="postgresqlprotopasswords.html">Password Method</a></li>
  <li><a href="postgresqlprotoconnectstringsauth.html">Connect Strings Auth</a></li>
  <li><a href="postgresqlprotouserlistauth.html">User List Auth</a></li>
</ul>

<p>When using the PostgreSQL protocol, the following encryption options are available:</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="postgresqlprototls.html">TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication</a></li>
</ul>

